  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"Jvsay\" id=\"Jvsay\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16a70a2a\" id=\"u16a70a2a\">节点</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u435762d8\" id=\"u435762d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4317b357\" id=\"u4317b357\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">ROS 中的每个节点都应该负责单一的、模块化的目的，例如控制车轮马达或发布来自激光测距仪的传感器数据。每个节点都可以通过主题、服务、操作或参数从其他节点发送和接收数据。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8bb490c9\" id=\"u8bb490c9\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fgif%2F27903758%2F1685430573239-f93d8bf8-1c4f-4861-bd59-637125efdf22.gif%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u99302fe0-61ad-429c-a426-4cd451f1e5f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u65bfc7a0-d0e5-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A455.46666666666664%2C%22height%22%3A256%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22Nodes-TopicandService.gif%22%2C%22size%22%3A2993370%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A854%2C%22originHeight%22%3A480%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22SERVICE%20SERVER%20NODE%20SERVICE%20MESSAGE%20REQUEST%20PUBLISHER%20RESPONSE%20SERVICE%20CLIENT%20TOPIC%20NODE%20NODE%20SUBSCRIBER%20SUBSCRIBER%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A12%2C%22text%22%3A%22SERVICE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A656%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A11%2C%22text%22%3A%22SERVER%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A660%2C%22y%22%3A106%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A12%2C%22text%22%3A%22NODE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A388%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22SERVICE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A622%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A14%2C%22text%22%3A%22MESSAGE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A384%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22REQUEST%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A647%2C%22y%22%3A175%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A14%2C%22text%22%3A%22PUBLISHER%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A379%2C%22y%22%3A189%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22RESPONSE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A128%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22SERVICE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A133%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22CLIENT%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A424%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A15%2C%22text%22%3A%22TOPIC%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A120%2C%22y%22%3A299%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A17%2C%22text%22%3A%22NODE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A657%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A12%2C%22text%22%3A%22NODE%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22SUBSCRIBER%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A638%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A13%2C%22text%22%3A%22SUBSCRIBER%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf7fb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud451f2d2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0c64bc96\" id=\"u0c64bc96\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb3da9f2\" id=\"ueb3da9f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">一个完整的机器人系统由许多协同工作的节点组成。在 ROS 2 中，单个可执行文件（C++ 程序、Python 程序等）可以包含一个或多个节点。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"cg6CD\" id=\"cg6CD\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b825582\" id=\"u7b825582\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">节点任务</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"y0xVx\" id=\"y0xVx\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34414a72\" id=\"u34414a72\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">1. 运行节点</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20run%20%3Cpackage_name%3E%20%3Cexecutable_name%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22om0Pn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9200daac\" id=\"u9200daac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57a981ff\" id=\"u57a981ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">例如：</span></p><ul list=\"uc29478a0\"><li fid=\"u879b02f0\" data-lake-id=\"ube679477\" id=\"ube679477\"><code data-lake-id=\"u609c9b9b\" id=\"u609c9b9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07511900\" id=\"u07511900\">ros2 run turtlesim turtlesim_node</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf0cc70a5\" id=\"uf0cc70a5\">运行小乌龟节点</span></li><li fid=\"u879b02f0\" data-lake-id=\"u9b337433\" id=\"u9b337433\"><code data-lake-id=\"u5928aad5\" id=\"u5928aad5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3edf107\" id=\"ud3edf107\">ros2 run rviz2 rviz2</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc600df3d\" id=\"uc600df3d\">运行可视化界面</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"Tr3Tr\" id=\"Tr3Tr\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc67011c\" id=\"ufc67011c\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">2. 获取节点列表</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20node%20list%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CAXGO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"V0HWg\" id=\"V0HWg\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07d1fd1e\" id=\"u07d1fd1e\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">3. 获取节点信息</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20node%20info%20%3Cnode_name%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22axD7W%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1b3266ba\" id=\"u1b3266ba\"><span data-lake-id=\"u287ce2ff\" id=\"u287ce2ff\">系统内置的节点都在如下目录：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ucb078748\" id=\"ucb078748\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5f801c6\" id=\"ud5f801c6\">/opt/ros/humble/lib</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6c52118d\" id=\"u6c52118d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b4a4a71\" id=\"u3b4a4a71\">例如：</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaaa6cef3\" id=\"uaaa6cef3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0023d693\" id=\"u0023d693\">ros2 node info /turtlesim</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u46eeab70\" id=\"u46eeab70\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ua3a63e4e\" id=\"ua3a63e4e\"> </span></p>",
